  "notes": "Encoder: kv_cache_bytes_per_token = 0, KV formula does not apply. Same parameter count as bge-base-en-v1.5 (109M) — both are BERT-base geometry (hidden 768, 12 layers, intermediate 3072). Key difference: max_position_embeddings 8192 vs BGE's 512, using RoPE with NTK scaling. This is the model that showed Alibaba's GTE family could match BGE on retrieval while supporting longer context. Vocab 30528 (6 more than BERT's 30522). pack_qkv true. MIT license. GGUF and ONNX ports exist.\n\nCONTEXT_SCALING_METHOD (ntk-aware): rope_scaling {type: 'ntk', factor 2.0} at rope_theta 500000 - NTK-aware base adjustment, a 2x extension from 4096. RELEASE DATE CORRECTED 2026-10-21: was 2023, now 2024 per the HF repo creation date (2024-04-20). The wrong year made every recency multiplier a no-op for this record.",
